      "message": "fix(motion): a cut point on the near mark of a tab end reads as near\n\nA zero-length piece at the walk end, or an arc mark with a rounding\nresidue, was read as far: a false hold for dense tabs\n(a_tab_that_grows_over_a_picked_start_says_so).\n\nRefs #2561\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
