      "message": "fix(motion): explicit NaN reads in the tab kerf tests, and the tab_kerf decision\n\nFour float tests used a negated comparison, which clippy refuses\n(neg_cmp_op_on_partial_ord). The explicit form keeps the same result for\nNaN in each operand: NaN reads as a touch or as \"left here\".\n\nAdds the tab_kerf section to docs/decisions/2561-tab-bridge-all-cuts.md.\n\nRefs #2561\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
